{"id":"09d41de396bccc46c3a77ab4577379e4d463ed11","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1231729","title":"AI 短剧 每月至少 1-2w 真的这么挣钱吗？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"SayHelloHi","excerpt":"问与答 - @SayHelloHi - 好友 OPC3 年 昨晚请客吃饭吃饭的时候问好友 最近是不是发财了 这么阔绰 舍得请吃饭了好友说：最近 1 年都在做大人看的 AI 短剧 现在竞争少 有人愿意付费看，需求量很旺盛；有人","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>好友 OPC3 年 昨晚请客吃饭</p>\n<p>吃饭的时候问好友 最近是不是发财了 这么阔绰 舍得请吃饭了</p>\n<p>好友说：最近 1 年都在做大人看的 AI 短剧 现在竞争少 有人愿意付费看，需求量很旺盛；有人愿意花钱自己当主角拍电影</p>\n<hr>\n<p>问每月收入如何？</p>\n<p>一个月最少 1-2w </p>\n<p>做出来如何挣钱？</p>\n<p>没有问 好友也没有说</p>\n<hr>\n<p>晚上到家后 用 Chrome 隐私模式搜索下 </p>\n<p>两个字：真行</p>\n<hr>\n<p>果然机会，是留给有准备的人</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/AI\"><li></li> AI</a><a href=\"/tag/短剧\"><li></li> 短剧</a><a href=\"/tag/赚钱\"><li></li> 赚钱</a></P><p><span>54 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-08-04 12:25:16 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17931268\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c4fe/52ac/36118_normal.png?m=1691894552\" alt=\"coolair\" data-uid=\"36118\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/coolair\">coolair</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 14:11:20 +08:00\">22h 54m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>成人短剧吧，正经短剧每个月花 1-2 万倒是正常。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17931271\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3f81/70cb/656604_normal.png?m=1712647280\" alt=\"tinx\" data-uid=\"656604\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/tinx\">tinx</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 14:11:48 +08:00\">22h 54m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>国内干这个 不怕进去吗</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17931335\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d961/3cd9/563553_normal.png?m=1749532589\" alt=\"SayHelloHi\" data-uid=\"563553\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/SayHelloHi\">SayHelloHi</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 14:20:28 +08:00\">22h 45m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/coolair\">coolair</a></p><p>是的 </p><p>@<a href=\"/member/tinx\">tinx</a></p><p>吃饭的时候以为是普通 AI 短剧 回来搜索才知道是大人的 AI 视频是这种视频 </p><p>至于风险 朋友应该知道吧</p><p>可能收益非常可观 非常暴利</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17931355\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0ec5/e8e0/80390_normal.png?m=1768046655\" alt=\"402124773\" data-uid=\"80390\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/402124773\">402124773</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 14:22:50 +08:00\">22h 42m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>一个月最少 1-2w<br>这个收入，冒这个险，不划算吧。要不是他说少了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17931445\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/78bd/3715/785641_normal.png?m=1782108176\" alt=\"semiboldhung\" data-uid=\"785641\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/semiboldhung\">semiboldhung</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 14:33:55 +08:00\">22h 31m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>X 上有一些男男的 AI 短剧，说实话建模有些是很好看的（这个应该是 prompt 的好坏），比一些长得丑的网黄还帅。声音也可以定制，不会出现一些奇怪的尖叫🐔</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17931456\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0c95ab24763086ed4e53587c209fa5dd?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"v00O\" data-uid=\"756509\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/v00O\">v00O</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 14:35:27 +08:00\">22h 30m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这点收益不值得去冒险吧！</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17931470\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3590/0a98/173969_normal.png?m=1747363963\" alt=\"coderluan\" data-uid=\"173969\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/coderluan\">coderluan</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 14:38:30 +08:00\">22h 27m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>制作贩卖淫秽物品属于判的严的，赚 5 万块钱就 3 年起判了，就这个承担的风险来说，一个月 1~2 万怎么也算不上赚钱，拉完了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17931508\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b316/d75e/520804_normal.png?m=1749177318\" alt=\"andyskaura\" data-uid=\"520804\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/andyskaura\">andyskaura</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 14:43:37 +08:00\">22h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>如果作为个人项目，成本也很高的。</p><p>我有个用户想咨询 ai 视频，用豆包写了一堆稿子和大纲，让我去生成，每集愿意给 50 块。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17931527\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/de31/6fb5/44664_normal.png?m=1495650798\" alt=\"flowerains\" data-uid=\"44664\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/flowerains\">flowerains</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 14:46:29 +08:00\">22h 19m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>一个月花 1-2W 吧。</p><p>你说的这种都是有固定的采购方的</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17931544\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/fe73b0e6cf5940b1b26d67ffb74b4fc1?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"xiapipi\" data-uid=\"199411\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xiapipi\">xiapipi</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 14:48:51 +08:00\">22h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>刑法上写的都赚钱，看你有没有胆子干了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17931560\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3f4e/e6b0/528534_normal.png?m=1744000017\" alt=\"no2cat\" data-uid=\"528534\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/no2cat\">no2cat</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 14:50:41 +08:00\">22h 15m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>一个月才 1-2 万，还要担风险，挺少的。赚这种钱就要把坐牢的成本也算上才对。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17931611\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a181/28da/17527_normal.png?m=1745458530\" alt=\"justfindu\" data-uid=\"17527\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/justfindu\">justfindu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 14:54:22 +08:00\">22h 11m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>大人看的  真的不怕?  <br>这收益率是不是太低了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17931641\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8553/adf9/10426_normal.png?m=1688377906\" alt=\"tf2\" data-uid=\"10426\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/tf2\">tf2</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 14:57:16 +08:00\">22h 8m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你这个短剧，是不是演到一半都不穿衣服了？？？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17931679\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/40eaa45a823f075189ca2a4f76343678?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jackOff\" data-uid=\"593397\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jackOff\">jackOff</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 15:02:07 +08:00\">22h 3m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>电报里好像有很多这种东西，我看过爱情公寓，仙剑奇侠传的成人版，非常逼真，完全看不出 ai 的痕迹</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17931766\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/cdfbcecfac10ddbff28d0a8edc3320df?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Razio\" data-uid=\"494931\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Razio\">Razio</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 15:11:42 +08:00\">21h 54m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>现在给他送进去，出来的早一点，还有机会走正路</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17931823\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2651d2e06496c1ef4e0e9e10081dc183?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jko123\" data-uid=\"222376\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jko123\">jko123</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 15:18:51 +08:00\">21h 46m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不是？这种东西敢跟身边的人说？万一遇到心里狭隘的来个举报，直接端了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17931839\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/95e31440ccd2ff3d03b29a5bf3b48b6d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"winnerczwx\" data-uid=\"297433\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/winnerczwx\">winnerczwx</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 15:21:17 +08:00\">21h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>冒着坐牢的风险一个月赚 1.5w? 关键被抓了要全额罚没啊, 罚款+没收才是重点</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17931888\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/259f/6be2/17328_normal.png?m=1405042050\" alt=\"churchmice\" data-uid=\"17328\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>26</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/churchmice\">churchmice</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 15:27:22 +08:00\">21h 38m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>看点日本老师的电影不好吗<br>看过一些 AI 短剧，那玩意是给人看的吗？<br>还有各种所谓的 AI 去马赛克，比没去更让人倒胃口</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17931933\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5c1fceaf8168e9e68fda158a84bafcf1?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ydong\" data-uid=\"626621\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>27</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ydong\">ydong</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 15:33:50 +08:00\">21h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>肉身在国内还是别搞这个了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17931965\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6b20eecbba98f121270fa56f0886b2f4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"soleils\" data-uid=\"314786\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>28</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/soleils\">soleils</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 15:38:06 +08:00\">21h 27m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>刀口舔血啊, 被抓就完蛋</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17932023\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0dae/9391/455039_normal.png?m=1769153923\" alt=\"BeforeTooLate\" data-uid=\"455039\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>29</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/BeforeTooLate\">BeforeTooLate</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 15:45:51 +08:00\">21h 19m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>AI 成人短剧有些剧情真的是突破各种道德枷锁，没法看。怀疑赚钱得应该是写编剧得那些吧。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17932122\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/fd3d/e72c/430477_normal.png?m=1569461183\" alt=\"EthanV2\" data-uid=\"430477\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>30</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/EthanV2\">EthanV2</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 15:57:06 +08:00\">21h 8m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>主要是擦边，而不是短剧，你去电报或者某些需要会员的社区和漫画 app ，看一下那些 AI 成人短剧和系列的 3D 漫画就知道，你看那些 3D 漫画，日本的 2D 动漫，成人的，基本上都赚钱，还有那些台湾和国内那些画手，都有固定金主，这种东西我觉得不在于 AI 短剧，而在于你找需求，国内做这擦边这行就像在水边走，很难说哪天保不齐就进去了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17932137\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f9e8/0e8c/707007_normal.png?m=1784532508\" alt=\"mizkan\" data-uid=\"707007\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>31</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/mizkan\">mizkan</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 15:58:46 +08:00\">21h 7m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你看到的机会恐怕都不是机会了吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17932204\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c4a0/452d/556606_normal.png?m=1784530402\" alt=\"Julaoshi\" data-uid=\"556606\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>32</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Julaoshi\">Julaoshi</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 16:07:47 +08:00\">20h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>有句玩笑话 刑法上五年以下的罪名已经不赚钱了 这种钱有的赚没得花 一旦被抓全吐出来 得不偿失啊</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17932205\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0b15/0d66/525806_normal.png?m=1715683975\" alt=\"cvooc\" data-uid=\"525806\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>33</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cvooc\">cvooc</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 16:07:59 +08:00\">20h 57m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>最近有留意到这种短剧, 平均 5 分钟视频里面 3 分钟正常剧情+2 分钟 NSFW, 还有魔改其他短剧的. 效果不咋好, 这不就是 AI 脱衣的翻版吗. 拉完了, 还很刑. 纯赚一波跑路. 付出收益不成比例,我是没这胆.</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17932223\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2803aebc6b39ed4ea3140a28febf01a5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"frankies\" data-uid=\"556542\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>34</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/frankies\">frankies</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 16:09:57 +08:00\">20h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>制作传播淫秽物品牟利罪，可是重罪，5W 收入就能判三年以上了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17932287\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/71cccdc034f76a049d380d32385666b4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"YNaN\" data-uid=\"387030\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>35</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/YNaN\">YNaN</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 16:16:39 +08:00\">20h 49m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>赚快钱的路径都写在刑法里不无道理</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17932293\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d80c/8b66/666086_normal.png?m=1703130789\" alt=\"kcerty\" data-uid=\"666086\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>36</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kcerty\">kcerty</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 16:17:41 +08:00\">20h 48m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/NIvxivj.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NIvxivj.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a>看过两个 ai 成人视频，人物身材做的太好看了，不过动作有些浮夸。我更好奇是怎么进行变现，如果是国内进行变现，风险太大了吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17932295\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f28bc154f4f5a1d30ed19e6e9827d2ed?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Cruzz\" data-uid=\"409014\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>37</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Cruzz\">Cruzz</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 16:17:48 +08:00\">20h 48m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>制作可比传播牛逼，这个价钱不合适。肉身在外当我没说</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17932363\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c01a9990e9f1bcbea1b8b6e4b0ed12f6?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"kuhung\" data-uid=\"239959\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>38</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kuhung\">kuhung</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 16:25:19 +08:00\">20h 40m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>还以为说的正规短剧。我试过正规的，调一个 1 分钟不到的片子，花了一下午去了八十块。成果还是端不出来。综合下来，ROI 不高，也不在我的特长和舒适区里面。就搁置了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17932364\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/40eaa45a823f075189ca2a4f76343678?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jackOff\" data-uid=\"593397\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>39</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jackOff\">jackOff</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 16:25:21 +08:00\">20h 40m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>成人色情抖音短视频短剧现在很火</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17932547\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9e80/b68e/131722_normal.png?m=1763695190\" alt=\"jpyl0423\" data-uid=\"131722\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>41</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jpyl0423\">jpyl0423</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 16:52:01 +08:00\">20h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>前段时间也刷到一些，还是没真人的刺激，主要是下半部分很假</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17932821\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6f90c08662f5b2a07406ad56d65f6550?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ylsc633\" data-uid=\"148317\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>42</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ylsc633\">ylsc633</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 17:31:30 +08:00\">19h 34m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>前段时间，特别是搜了下，看了下 成人短剧</p><p>特别是 有一些拿 电视剧 然后魔改的，看的我生理不适</p><p>电视剧 + 知名 影星  改的，看的有种恐惧感</p><p>就不看了</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17932908\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cf73/a199/122425_normal.png?m=1733065612\" alt=\"jtam\" data-uid=\"122425\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>44</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jtam\">jtam</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 17:45:51 +08:00\">19h 19m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>楼主开个 tg 群细聊吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17933584\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0cd8/88e2/572662_normal.png?m=1722085499\" alt=\"zachary99\" data-uid=\"572662\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>46</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zachary99\">zachary99</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 21:58:20 +08:00\">15h 7m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>ai 制作真的太贵了，个人用户我即梦一个月积分都没搞出一分钟</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17933731\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/40eaa45a823f075189ca2a4f76343678?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jackOff\" data-uid=\"593397\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>47</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jackOff\">jackOff</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-03 23:30:43 +08:00\">13h 35m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>找到了黄豆魔改短剧，剧情很顶很色气</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17935199\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3715/22e9/212571_normal.png?m=1757058478\" alt=\"edisonwong\" data-uid=\"212571\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>50</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/edisonwong\">edisonwong</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 11:05:36 +08:00\">2h 0m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这风险，得加个 0 才值得做。一个月 10-20w 利润</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17935381\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2273/0636/253364_normal.png?m=1749459724\" alt=\"iv8d\" data-uid=\"253364\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>51</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/iv8d\">iv8d</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 11:27:46 +08:00\">1h 38m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>进去试试不就知道，说不定就是一条路呢</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17935559\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5e2c/35af/114646_normal.png?m=1782128891\" alt=\"enrolls\" data-uid=\"114646\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>53</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/enrolls\">enrolls</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-04 11:51:18 +08:00\">1h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>什么？找到了另类拿公粮的方式？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"好友 OPC3 年 昨晚请客吃饭 吃饭的时候问好友 最近是不是发财了 这么阔绰 舍得请吃饭了 好友说：最近 1 年都在做大人看的 AI 短剧 现在竞争少 有人愿意付费看，需求量很旺盛；有人愿意花钱自己当主角拍电影 问每月收入如何？ 一个月最少 1-2w 做出来如何挣钱？ 没有问 好友也没有说 晚上到家后 用 Chrome 隐私模式搜索下 两个字：真行 果然机会，是留给有准备的人 AI 短剧 赚钱54 replies • 2026-08-04 12:25:16 +08:00 1 coolair 22h 54m ago 1 成人短剧吧，正经短剧每个月花 1-2 万倒是正常。 2 tinx 22h 54m ago 国内干这个 不怕进去吗 3 SayHelloHi OP 22h 45m ago @coolair是的 @tinx吃饭的时候以为是普通 AI 短剧 回来搜索才知道是大人的 AI 视频是这种视频 至于风险 朋友应该知道吧可能收益非常可观 非常暴利 4 402124773 22h 42m ago 一个月最少 1-2w这个收入，冒这个险，不划算吧。要不是他说少了 6 semiboldhung 22h 31m ago 1 X 上有一些男男的 AI 短剧，说实话建模有些是很好看的（这个应该是 prompt 的好坏），比一些长得丑的网黄还帅。声音也可以定制，不会出现一些奇怪的尖叫🐔 7 v00O 22h 30m ago 这点收益不值得去冒险吧！ 8 coderluan 22h 27m ago 制作贩卖淫秽物品属于判的严的，赚 5 万块钱就 3 年起判了，就这个承担的风险来说，一个月 1~2 万怎么也算不上赚钱，拉完了。 9 andyskaura 22h 22m ago 如果作为个人项目，成本也很高的。我有个用户想咨询 ai 视频，用豆包写了一堆稿子和大纲，让我去生成，每集愿意给 50 块。 10 flowerains 22h 19m ago 一个月花 1-2W 吧。你说的这种都是有固定的采购方的 11 xiapipi 22h 16m ago 刑法上写的都赚钱，看你有没有胆子干了。 13 no2cat 22h 15m ago 一个月才 1-2 万，还要担风险，挺少的。赚这种钱就要把坐牢的成本也算上才对。 16 justfindu 22h 11m ago 大人看的 真的不怕? 这收益率是不是太低了 17 tf2 22h 8m ago 你这个短剧，是不是演到一半都不穿衣服了？？？ 19 jackOff 22h 3m ago 电报里好像有很多这种东西，我看过爱情公寓，仙剑奇侠传的成人版，非常逼真，完全看不出 ai 的痕迹 20 Razio 21h 54m ago 现在给他送进去，出来的早一点，还有机会走正路 22 jko123 21h 46m ago 不是？这种东西敢跟身边的人说？万一遇到心里狭隘的来个举报，直接端了 24 winnerczwx 21h 44m ago 冒着坐牢的风险一个月赚 1.5w? 关键被抓了要全额罚没